    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Top-k heap</span><span class=\"chip\">Quickselect</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/kth-largest-element-in-an-array/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 215</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Kth Largest Element in an Array</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: you do not need the whole order, only which side of a pivot the answer is on - a size-k min-heap gives O(n log k), and quickselect with a random pivot and a 3-way partition gives O(n) on average with O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
